|               |       FlightSqlExec sql=SELECT id, name, age, city, score FROM test_data WHERE ((((bucket(3, "id") = '0') OR (bucket(3, "id") = '1')) OR (bucket(3, "id") = '2')))                         |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                            |
